35,2,1,talk,Mio,,A third of us can't make the 9am start without a bed. That's a huge cost.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The seniors say mixing only happens when we sleep together. That is key.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,Our own hall is booked by three other clubs. We'd have to train at odd hours.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Public beds are 1,100 yen a night. But the lottery is a nightmare.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The inland clubs slept eight to a room. That explains the bad sleep.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, if we go inland, the transport costs will be massive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, is the lottery really that difficult? I worry about the paperwork.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,Cooking duty took two hours a day last year. I don't want to repeat that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Yes, the application is nine pages long. One date change means starting over.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,Whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits. That's a risk if someone drops out.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if we stay on campus, we avoid the transport costs entirely.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"But if we stay on campus, the year groups won't mix. That is my concern.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The canteen is closed. We'd have to cook or eat out. Both are expensive.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I really want a place where we can sleep well. The inland option sounds risky.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The accounts show transport was 38% of the cost last year. We need to be careful.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I think we need a place with kitchen staff to save time and money.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,A coastal lodge might offer that. But it is far away.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am leaning towards a place with staff to handle the meals.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am worried about the sleep quality at the public centre.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I need to see the full cost breakdown before I can agree to anything.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
