66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Ryuji, the lottery for B is too stressful. I prefer the certainty of C.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. The cooking duty at A is a dealbreaker for me.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,I am still worried about the sleep at B. C might be better.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I need to see the exact quote for C to compare it with the transport costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"The flat fee for C might be higher, but the side costs are lower.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I think C is the best balance of social and practical needs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am willing to try C if the meals are handled by staff.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I hope the beds at C are comfortable. I really need good sleep.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I will vote for C if the total cost is within our budget.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,I am voting for C. The included meals are a big plus.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am voting for C. The whole building will help us bond.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am voting for C. No cooking duty is a relief.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Rin,,I am voting for C. I hope the sleep is good.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"I am voting for C. The cost is high, but the benefits are clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
